  "formations": [],
  "examples": [
    {
      "source_id": 5726,
      "position": 0,
      "japanese": "雪だからこそ、うちにいたくない。雪の日にうちにいるのは寂しすぎる。",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e9%9b%aa\"><span>雪</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%a0%e3%81%8b%e3%82%89%e3%81%93%e3%81%9d\"><strong>だからこそ</strong></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%80%81%e3%81%86%e3%81%a1%e3%81%ab%e3%81%84%e3%81%9f%e3%81%8f%e3%81%aa%e3%81%84%e3%80%82\"><span>、うちにいたくない。</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e9%9b%aa%e3%81%ae\"><span>雪の</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e6%97%a5%e3%81%ab%e3%81%86%e3%81%a1%e3%81%ab%e3%81%84%e3%82%8b%e3%81%ae%e3%81%af\"><span>日にうちにいるのは</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%af%82%e3%81%97%e3%81%99%e3%81%8e%e3%82%8b%e3%80%82\"><span>寂しすぎる。</span></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "雪",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "だからこそ",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        },
        {
          "text": "、うちにいたくない。雪の日にうちにいるのは寂しすぎる。",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        }
      ],
      "reading": "ゆきだからこそ、うちにいたくない。ゆきのひにうちにいるのはさびしすぎる。",
      "credits_raw": "srobertson",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "I don't want to stay at home, especially since it's snowing. On snowy days, being at home is too lonely.",
          "html": "<span>I don't want to stay at home, </span><strong>especially since </strong><span>it's snowing. On snowy days, being at home is too lonely. </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "I don't want to stay at home, ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            },
            {
              "text": "especially since ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": "it's snowing. On snowy days, being at home is too lonely. ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "source_id": 5727,
      "position": 1,
      "japanese": "頭がいいと思っているからこそ、厳しくしつけるのです。",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e9%a0%ad%e3%81%8c%e3%81%84%e3%81%84%e3%81%a8\"><span>頭がいいと</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e6%80%9d%e3%81%a3%e3%81%a6%e3%81%84%e3%82%8b\"><span>思っている</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%8b%e3%82%89%e3%81%93%e3%81%9d\"><strong>からこそ</strong></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%80%81\"><span>、</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%8e%b3%e3%81%97%e3%81%8f%e3%81%97%e3%81%a4%e3%81%91%e3%82%8b%e3%81%ae%e3%81%a7%e3%81%99%e3%80%82\"><span>厳しくしつけるのです。</span></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "頭がいいと思っている",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "からこそ",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        },
        {
          "text": "、厳しくしつけるのです。",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        }
      ],
      "reading": "あたまがいいとおもっているからこそ、きびしくしつけるのです。",
      "credits_raw": "srobertson",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "It's precisely because I think you've got brains that I'm bringing you up so strictly.",
          "html": "<span>It's </span><strong>precisely because </strong><span>I think you've got brains that I'm bringing you up so strictly. </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "It's ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            },
            {
              "text": "precisely because ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": "I think you've got brains that I'm bringing you up so strictly. ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "source_id": 5728,
      "position": 2,
      "japanese": "実は、知らない人ばかりだったからこそ、言いにくいことも言うことができたのだ。",
      "japanese_html": "<a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e5%ae%9f%e3%81%af%e3%80%81\"><span>実は、</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e7%9f%a5%e3%82%89%e3%81%aa%e3%81%84\"><span>知らない</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e4%ba%ba%e3%81%b0%e3%81%8b%e3%82%8a%e3%81%a0%e3%81%a3%e3%81%9f\"><span>人ばかりだった</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%81%8b%e3%82%89%e3%81%93%e3%81%9d\"><strong>からこそ</strong></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e3%80%81\"><span>、</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e8%a8%80%e3%81%84%e3%81%ab%e3%81%8f%e3%81%84%e3%81%93%e3%81%a8%e3%82%82\"><span>言いにくいことも</span></a><a href=\"https://takoboto.jp/?q=%e8%a8%80%e3%81%86%e3%81%93%e3%81%a8%e3%81%8c%e3%81%a7%e3%81%8d%e3%81%9f%e3%81%ae%e3%81%a0%e3%80%82\"><span>言うことができたのだ。</span></a>",
      "segments": [
        {
          "text": "実は、知らない人ばかりだった",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        },
        {
          "text": "からこそ",
          "grammar_highlight": true
        },
        {
          "text": "、言いにくいことも言うことができたのだ。",
          "grammar_highlight": false
        }
      ],
      "reading": "じつは、しらないひとばかりだったからこそ、いいにくいこともいうことができたのだ。",
      "credits_raw": "srobertson",
      "translations": [
        {
          "language": "en",
          "text": "Actually, it was especially_because they were all people I didn't know that I was able to say things I usually find difficult to say.",
          "html": "<span>Actually, it was </span><strong>especially_because </strong><span>they were all people I didn't know that I was able to say things I usually find difficult to say. </span>",
          "segments": [
            {
              "text": "Actually, it was ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            },
            {
              "text": "especially_because ",
              "grammar_highlight": true
            },
            {
              "text": "they were all people I didn't know that I was able to say things I usually find difficult to say. ",
              "grammar_highlight": false
            }
          ]
        }
